{
  "id": "1CO.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Bakolinto 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwilanga kūfuma mu ya kale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we bang'wise, natatogilwe ng'wikale mutamanile gīkī, a bakūlūgenji bise baalī ha sīlīlī y'ilunde pye a bose, nū mu nyanza bakabīta pye a bose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pye būbatīījiwa mulī Musa, ng'wilunde na mu nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama pye balyaga shilīwa sha mbika īmò, sha kūfuma ū kūlī Moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī pye bang'waga shakūng'wa sha Kiimoyo, nguno bang'waga kūfuma mu shiganga sha Kiimoyo īsho shalī hamò nabo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hamò nabo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, shabalondeelaga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ī shiganga shene shalī h'ū Kilisito ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bingī babo batanyegije ū Mulungu, būshilīla kū matogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ī yenīyī īkaja gīko, būbize ho būlolelo kūlwa nguno yise, tūtizūbiza ba kwikūmva yabūbi gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga a boi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī yaya ū kūbiza balamya ba mashiikolile gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga bamò babo, ūmo gwandīkilwe gīkī, “A banhū bakigasha kūlya na kūng'wa, hūna būbūūka kūbina!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama dūtizīīta būjingi gīt'ūmo bamò babo bakīītīla, kūshisha lūshikū lūmò būhūlūlūka banhū shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shidatū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hangī tūtizūbiza ba kūngema ū Seeba gīt'ūmo bamò babo bakangema; būyūbūlagwa na mayoka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama yaya nū kūduguma, gīt'ūmo bamò babo bakadugumīla, būyagajiwa na nyagaja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ī mihayo yenīyo īkabilongela a benabo, yūbiza būlolelo; hama yandīkwa kūlwa kūtūhūgūla a bise abo jatūpandīkile ī shikū ja kū būkalīkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūyo īmīīlile ni ilang'hanage atizūgwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūtaalī kūng'wizīīla kūgeng'wa, ūlū ītī gīt'ūmo kūkabizīīlaga banhū na kale. Gwike ū Mulungu alī ng'wishigwa no, atīko ū kūmulekanīja mugeng'we kūtinda ūmo būlī ū būdūla wing'we; alīyo ū mu kūgeng'wa kwenūko, akūbeeja nī nzīla ya kūpīlīla, mudūle ū kwiyūmīlīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūsangīlīja kalamīje",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū badūgū bane, lekanagi nayo ī mihayo ya witongeleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīwīla banhū bitegeleja, īlolagi chiza īyo nalīyīhaya yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikombe sha sangīla īsho tūkanūmbaga Mulungu kūlwasho, angū shitī sha būsangī mu mininga ga ng'wa Kilisito? Nū ngatī ūyo tūkagūmegaga, nago gūtī gwa būsangī mu mīlī go ng'wa Kilisito? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lūūlū īkī ū ngatī gūlī gūmò, hū kūhaya na a bise abo tūlī bingī tūlī mīlī gūmò, nguno pyī tūkasangīlaga ngatī gūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biganikīlagi dūhū nūūlū a Baisilaeli ba mu mīlī, angū abo bakashilyaga ī shitambo, batī basangīji ba ha ng'walīlo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū mhayo ūyo nalīgūhaya ni gūlī ginehe? Hamo gīkī ī shitambo sha ha witongeleja shikagunanhaga? Nūūlū gīkī ī shikolo īsho shikalamiagwa shilī na būdūla bo kwīta mhayo gose gose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo nalīgūhaya gūlī gīkī, ī shitambo īsho shikafunyiagwa gakafunījiagwa masamva, atafunījiagwa Mulungu; na lūūlū ū nene natatogilwe a bing'we mubize na būsangī na masamva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutūdūla kūng'wa shikombe sha ng'wa Seeba na shikombe sha masamva; mutūdūla kūsangīla ha meza ya ng'wa Seeba na ha meza ya masamva! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo tūtogilwe kūnsaayīcha ū Seeba! A bise tūlī na nguzu ja kūntinda ū wei?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwīta yose kūlw'ikūjo lya ng'wa Seeba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pyī ī shikolo shizunīlīgije, alīyo h'ītī gīkī ī shose shilī na solobo; na ng'hana pyī ī shikolo shizunīlīgije, alīyo nahene ī shose shitazengaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizūbiza ho munhū wa kwikala akūkoobaga shakwe we ng'wenekīlī dūhū; alīyo ng'ūbakoobela nī sha biching'wi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyagi būlī nyama ījo jikajinjiagwa mu sokoni, yaya ū kwikala ng'ūbūja būja nose kwingīja makoye mu moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī sī īlī ya ng'wa Seeba, nī shisho shokalile mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, a banhū abo batī bazunya ūlū būng'wegeleja ha shilīwa, ning'we ng'ūbiza mutogilwe ū kūja, lyagi būlī shikolo īsho mulatengelwe; yaya ū kūbūgīlīja būgīlīja mutiziyenhela makoye mu moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū wigela munhū ose ose wa kūmuwīla gīkī, “Ī shenīshi shalī shafunyiagwa kūbiza shitambo,” lekagi ū kūlya kūlwa nguno yakwe ū ng'hayi ng'wenūyo, na kūlwa nguno ya wiyangūji wa mu moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīhaya wiyangūji wa mu moyo gwakwe ūyo; būtī wako ū bebe, nguno nibūlī ū wiyabī bone būlamulwe kūlwa makoye ga mu moyo go ng'wa munhū ūngī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, ū nene ūlū nalīsangīla kūlya shilīwa mu kūlūmba, nibūlī niyenheleje kūsondagūlwa kūlwa nguno ya shilīwa īsho nalīlūmba kūlwasho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ūlū mulīlya nūūlū mulīng'wa, nūūlū mulībeeja mhayo gose gose; beejagi pyī ī yose kūlw'ikūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūbipamya a banhū; ni babizage Bayudaya nūūlū ba mahanga gangī, pyī nūūlū ī kanisa ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ītagi gīt'ūmo nakwītīlaga nene mu mihayo yose. Nakwītaga pyī ī yose ītī kūlwa kūkooba solobo yane nene ng'wenekīlī, alīyo kūlwa banhū bingī, gīkī bapījiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
